<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR1d0052-la-0b74d5d1" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Sinarum Scientia Politico-Moralis a P. Prospero Intorcetta in lucem edita </title><editor role="translator">Intorcetta</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>Sinarum Scientia Politico-Moralis a P. Prospero Intorcetta in lucem edita </title>Canton, 1667, Paris, 1679</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR1d0052"><title xml:lang="och">禮記(正文)</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="la">Latin</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-04-30T23:19:31.906+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T21:59:22.951+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T21:59:42.363+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T22:01:43.465+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T22:02:01.505+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR1d0052-start"><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:16:51.575+09:00">Sententiae Sinicae . Liber inter Confucii libros secundus</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:07:13.072+09:00">Quod coelo inditum est dicitur natura rationalis:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:16:54.268+09:00">quod conformitur huic naturae, dicitur regula;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:05:19.684+09:00">restaurare hanc regulam dicitur institutio.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:31.712+09:00">Regula haec </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:36.568+09:00">non potest momento temporis abesse;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:58.77+09:00">si posset abesse; non esset regula.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T23:55:50.037+09:00">Hac de causa perfectus vir attendit et invigilat in his etiam quae non videntur:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:08:13.53+09:00">timet ac pauet in his etiam quae non audiuntur.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:09:48.746+09:00">non apparent quia recondita:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:10:08.659+09:00">non sunt manifesta, quia subtilia.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:22:05.568+09:00">Ideò perfectus vir inuigilat sui secreto.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:23:57.157+09:00">Gaudium, ira, tristitia, hilaritas, priusquam pullulent, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:24:10.9+09:00">dicuntur medium seu natura indifferens:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:24:54.474+09:00">ubi pullularint et omnia attigerint rectam mensuram; </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:25:18.384+09:00">dicuntur concordia.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:27:04.251+09:00">medium</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:27:43.183+09:00">est orbis magnum fundamentum:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:32:55.009+09:00">concordia </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:33:05.341+09:00">est orbis universalis regula.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:36:35.95+09:00">Perfectius medio et concordia, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:26:52.137+09:00">coeli ac terrae status quietus,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:26:48.247+09:00">et omnium rerum propagatio existit.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:27:01.915+09:00">Confucius ait,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:27:17.468+09:00">perfectus vir tenet medium:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:30:23.007+09:00">improbus praevaricatur medium.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:31:48.718+09:00">Vir perfectus habet medium; </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:32:04.06+09:00">et quia perfectus est, ideò semper tenet medium.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:39:13.339+09:00">Improbus etiam habet medium quod teneat;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:40:45.198+09:00">sed quia improbus, ideò non veret ut illud praevaricari.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:41:20.098+09:00">Confucius ait:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:42:08.502+09:00">medium ô quam illud sublime!</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:48:27.602+09:00">quod è vulgo pauci illud teneant, iam diu est.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:49:15.355+09:00">Confucius ait:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:49:43.027+09:00">cur via haec non frequentetur,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:49:48.03+09:00">ego novi;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:50:34.295+09:00">quia scilicet prudentes transgrediuntur;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:50:40.917+09:00">rudes non pertingunt.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:51:15.901+09:00">Cur item via haec non sit perfecta,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:51:25.819+09:00">ego novi:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:51:36.676+09:00">quia scilicet sapientes excedunt;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:51:41.963+09:00">inertes non attingunt.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T20:09:25.929+09:00">Hominum nullus non bibit et comedit: </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:55:38.195+09:00">at pauci valent dignoscere sapores.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:55:54.445+09:00">Confucius ait:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:56:10.418+09:00">etiam hanc non frequentari, proh! quàm dolendum!</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:56:14.347+09:00">Confucius ait:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:56:30.584+09:00">Xun Imperatoris, illius quam magna prudentia! </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:58:51.378+09:00">Xun solebat consulere suos, et solebat examinare quaecumque etiam vulgaria suorum responsa,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T19:59:17.14+09:00">dissimulando mala, et depraedicando bona:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T20:00:24.15+09:00">arripiensque illorum duo extrema, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T20:00:32.226+09:00">utebatur eorum medio ad populum regendum.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-4a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T20:01:00.844+09:00">Atque haec ille fuere propter quae factus est Xun, talis scilicet ac tantus Imperator.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-29T20:09:47.689+09:00">Confucius ait:</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>